  {
    "knowledge_point": {
      "db_id": 17592186115299,
      "id": "f9469d5c-e097-590c-8ddb-2c7fda353fac",
      "title": "Classifying a System as Consistent Dependent, Consistent Independent, or Inconsistent"
    },
    "question": {
      ":question/id": "14916312-5c35-5329-8898-deadf3ec999e",
      ":question/difficulty": ":question.difficulty/hard",
      ":question/problem": "Consider the following system of equations.\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}x-3y-3z &=-1 \\\\ 2x-5y-8z &=-4 \\\\ -2x+4y+10z &=4\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nWhich of the following statements are true?\n\nSelect all that apply.\n\n- **I.** The system is consistent independent\n- **II.** The system is inconsistent\n- **III.** The system is consistent dependent",
      ":question/worked-solution": "To classify the system, we first need to find its solution. The augmented matrix for this system is\n\n$$\nM=\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & -3 & -3 & -1 \\\\ 2 & -5 & -8 & -4 \\\\ -2 & 4 & 10 & 4\\end{array}\\right].\n$$\n\nUsing the method of Gaussian elimination, we can reduce this matrix to row echelon form as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}M & =\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & -3 & -3 & -1 \\\\ 2 & -5 & -8 & -4 \\\\ -2 & 4 & 10 & 4\\end{array}\\right] & {R}_{2}:={R}_{2}+(-2){R}_{1} \\\\ & \u223c\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & -3 & -3 & -1 \\\\ 0 & 1 & -2 & -2 \\\\ -2 & 4 & 10 & 4\\end{array}\\right] & {R}_{3}:={R}_{3}+(2){R}_{1} \\\\ & \u223c\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & -3 & -3 & -1 \\\\ 0 & 1 & -2 & -2 \\\\ 0 & -2 & 4 & 2\\end{array}\\right] & {R}_{3}:={R}_{3}+(2){R}_{2} \\\\ & \u223c\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & -3 & -3 & -1 \\\\ 0 & 1 & -2 & -2 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & -2\\end{array}\\right]\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe final row corresponds to the equation $0x+0y+0z=-2,$ and this has no solution. Therefore, our system has no solution, and we conclude that the system is inconsistent.\n\nAs a result, only statement II is true.",
      ":question/answer-fields": [
        {
          ":answer-field/id": "3dccebb6-cc93-5a57-8e06-1057a5c97200",
          ":answer-field/key": "I",
          ":answer-field/type": ":answer-field.type/checkbox",
          ":answer-field/choices": [
            {
              ":answer/id": "cb017c74-466a-56af-b58b-8dd22e31f0fb",
              ":answer/type": ":answer.type/text",
              ":answer/value": "false"
            },
            {
              ":answer/id": "6465a79e-09e4-5088-93a7-d6904e486d0e",
              ":answer/type": ":answer.type/text",
              ":answer/value": "true"
            }
          ],
          ":answer-field/correct": [
            ":answer/id",
            "cb017c74-466a-56af-b58b-8dd22e31f0fb"
          ]
